# Goes at the ROOT of the plugins.dariobimbi.com document root — one level ABOVE
# migration-safety-net-for-divi/. Without it, the bare subdomain shows either an
# Apache directory listing or a 403, both of which look broken to anyone who
# trims the URL to check the domain.
#
# 302 rather than 301: temporary on purpose, so it stops cleanly once there is a
# real index page listing more than one plugin.
Options -Indexes
RedirectMatch 302 ^/$ /migration-safety-net-for-divi/
